":"paragraph","text":"質問返し〜(^o^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"★ナスビ元気？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"*まあやが東京に出てきて、ナスビ知り合いのお家に行ってしまったけど\n元気だよ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アバリンは相変わらず暴れん坊みたい〜笑笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"覚えてくれててありがとう♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"★バナナの抱き枕使ってる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"*いつも抱っこしてるよ〜あれがないとダメです......笑\nでもね、あのねぇ......新しい抱き枕いつか買おうとか考えてます......涙"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/09/06/5841263/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"★落ち込んだ時どうしてる？自分を変えたい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"*落ち込んだ時は家で泣いたり、音楽聞いたり、誰かに話せるようになったら話をしたりするよ...\n自分を変えたい！って気持ちも凄くわかる\n同じように思って落ち込んだ時もある\nでも そのままでいいよって言ってくれる人もいて...だから今の自分を大切にしてほしい..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも毎日努力してたら絶対変われると思ってる...いい方向に変われるように\n一緒に成長していけたら嬉しいなぁ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"★握手会で何話そう？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"*そうだなぁ服や その地方の食べ物や乃木坂の歌で何が好きとか...色々話そうよ〜♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"★握手券を1枚ずつ出すかまとめるか迷う"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"*ありがとう〜(^o^)\nどれも嬉しい〜♪\nいっぱい話すならまとめる？ちょっとずつ話すなら一枚ずつ？笑\nわかんないーーーo(T□T)o笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"★今回のツアーで思い出に残った事ある？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"*皆の笑顔！ 顔を思い出したり、やっぱり声援や団扇やタオルを見ると嬉しかったし、メンバーやスタッフさんやファンの皆との一体感が忘れられません＼(^-^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"★文化祭とかある？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"*あるよ〜(^o^)凄く楽しいよ〜今みんなで準備中ですっ♪放課後残ったり朝早くいったりして皆で楽しくやってるよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/09/06/5841263/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/09/06/5841263/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントの中に今、入院中って方がいて...\nまあやのお兄ちゃんも同じだから\n早くよくなってほしいです......\nパワーいっぱい送るねっ！？♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(↓※最後にまた学校帰りのまあやでっ↓)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/09/06/5841263/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/09/06/5841263/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ねぇねぇねぇ皆の好きなコンビニの美味しいものってなぁに？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/09/06/5841263/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/09/06/5841263/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めちゃしりたいなっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/09/06/5841263/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/09/06/5841263/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BYE"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/09/06/5841263/0009.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}